  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WYC-Mother Tongue Based Multilingual Education (MTB MLE) in Segen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Children in the language communities of the Segen Area People&apos;s Zone in Ethiopia (Konso, Ale, Dirayta, Koorete, and Burji) are enabled to learn successfully in their mother-tongue, and are well prepared for further learning and living in language(s) of wider communication.</narrative>
  </description>
